      55.89,
      502.93,
      546.93,
      524.92
    ],
    "text": "2. The Universities Provident Fund Ordinance No. 1 of 2015 published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1906/8 ofMarch 17, 2015, is hereby amended as follows :-",
